# Package data pulled into sdists/wheels via [tool.setuptools] include-package-data.
#
# _static carries every built UI surface:
#   - _static/app        → SPA build (index.html + hashed assets/ + export/), gitignored
#   - _static/dashboard  → legacy dashboard HTML/JS/CSS
#   - _static/ui         → legacy per-run UI
#   - _static/docs       → built docs site (when present)
# migrations carries alembic.ini, env.py, script.py.mako and versions/.
# (qym_platform/product_eval_presets is a regular package of .py files and is
# packaged automatically — no graft needed.)
graft qym_platform/_static
graft qym_platform/migrations

global-exclude __pycache__
global-exclude *.py[cod]
global-exclude .DS_Store
